## Backup and Recovery

### Automated Backup Script
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# backup.sh
DATE=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)
mysqldump -u $DB_USER -p$DB_PASSWORD $DB_NAME > /backups/db_backup_$DATE.sql
find /backups -name "db_backup_*.sql" -mtime +7 -delete
```

